  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "to 23. Apply F-119's acceptance criteria 1 to 23 unchanged, on the F-119B round head. \u2014 verify: as named in `delivery/features/F-119/spec.md` (gate `delivery/checks.sh`, `frontend/e2e/retrospective.spec.ts`, `npm test` in `frontend/`).",
    "(UX-5-1) At 390px width on `/projects/<2001>/retrospective?dossier=5001`, every control in the form that takes keyboard focus (reached by Tab from the first box through to Save and the decisions and follow-up controls) ends fully above the fixed Save bar: its bounding box bottom is at or above the bar's top. For each one, `document.elementFromPoint` at the control's centre returns that control or one of its descendants. Negative case: a control hidden under the bar fails the check. \u2014 verify: the phone focus test in `frontend/e2e/retrospective.spec.ts` (Playwright, mobile 390px project), run on the F-119B round head and recorded in the round's `checks.md`."
  ],
