    "rated_by": "readiness",
    "rationale": "Medium, unchanged from F-119. The screen has several behaviours (versioned save, action creation, checklist link) and a cross-layer contract (revisions, evidence ids, the `summary` convention). It writes internal meeting records only; no money, payroll, external messaging, auth or migrations, and saves append versions. Surfaces are ui (phone layout and focus behaviour, product-visible form change), api (live 1.24.0 operations) and contract-change (three boxes packed into one `summary`). Product acceptance is required for the changed form layout and the hidden draft, as in F-119."
  },
